				<r3d:description language="eng">GCRIS Database is a research and performance evaluation information system that enables searching and discovering all research outputs within the Izmir Institute of Technology research ecosystem, associating these outputs with researchers, providing advanced reporting with different metrics, and supporting corporate strategic decisions. Besides, it is an institutional repository at international standards that brings together and organizes all kinds of academic outputs related to research activities and allows sharing with the whole scientific world by providing long-term preservation.</r3d:description>
